    "location": "html-block:36",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:37",
    "text": "Our Bulletin Micro830® 2080-LC30 controllers are discontinued and no longer available for sale.",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:38",
    "text": "To support your transition, we recommend that you migrate to the Micro820® 2080-LC20 controllers or to the newer Micro850® 2080-L50E controllers with additional capabilities to expand application for digital transformation.",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:39",
    "text": "Product Compatibility and Migration Solutions",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:40",
    "text": "Demanding market conditions pose significant challenges. Across the enterprise and throughout the lifecycle, you must continuously strive for ways to leverage your existing automation investment.",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:41",
    "text": "Let Rockwell Automation help you determine your migration options and show you the benefits, including better performance, more informed business decisions, reduced maintenance costs, and quicker response to changing market demands.",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:42",
    "text": "Use the Product Lifecycle Status search tool to find specific lifecycle information by catalog number.",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:43",
    "text": "Learn more about our Product Compatibility and Migration Solutions.",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
